      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "In September 2021, the Commission granted ISP a license to build and operate its proposed storage facility."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Commission",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0000-0001",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Commission denied Fasken's petition to intervene."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Fifth Circuit",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0000-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Fifth Circuit vacated ISP's license."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Texas",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0000-0004",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "Texas and Fasken argue they qualify as parties because they participated in the licensing proceeding by submitting comments on the draft EIS and, in Fasken's case, by attempting to intervene."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Fasken",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0000-0005",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "Texas and Fasken argue they qualify as parties because they participated in the licensing proceeding by submitting comments on the draft EIS and, in Fasken's case, by attempting to intervene."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Fasken",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0000-0007",
      "kind": "allegation",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 10,
        "start": 10
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Fasken argued that the facility created an unacceptably high risk of environmental contamination."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Fasken",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0001-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 12,
        "start": 12
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "Second, Fasken contends that the Commission erroneously denied Fasken's intervention petition. Specifcally, Fasken contends that the Commission's regulations governing inter-\nvention are inconsistent with the text of the Atomic Energy\nAct and set too high a bar for intervention."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Texas and Fasken",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0001-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 12,
        "start": 12
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "Third, Texas and Fasken claim that their statutory claims are reviewable even if they were not parties to the Commis-\nsion's licensing proceeding."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0001-0006",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 18,
        "start": 18
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "This Court's leading case on post-APA ultra vires review is Leedom v. Kyne, 358 U. S. 184 (1958)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0002-0007",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 23,
        "start": 23
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "And the dissent's theory that the Atomic Energy Act does not authorize storage of spent nuclear fuel anywhere would have extraordinary consequences."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0002-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 26,
        "start": 26
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Commission applied its regulations implementing \u00a7 2239 and denied Fasken intervention."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "State of Texas",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0002-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 32,
        "start": 32
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "Governor Greg Abbott warned that storing spent fuel on \u201ca concrete pad\u201d in an oilfeld containing more than 40% of America's proven oil reserves would be \u201cdangerous.\u201d"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0003-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 34,
        "start": 34
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The D. C. Circuit consolidated those challenges into one proceeding and dispatched them all in a short, unpublished order."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0003-0004",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "If more evidence were needed, the 1980 regulations on which the NRC now seeks to rely would provide it. There, the agency explained its view that \u201c[s]pent fuel includes the special nuclear material, byproduct material, source material, and other radioactive materials associated with fuel assemblies.\u201d 45 Fed. Reg. 74700\u201374701 (emphasis added)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0004-0002",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 45,
        "start": 45
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The agency accepted those comments and undertook to address them in its fnal EIS."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0004-0003",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 45,
        "start": 45
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "After preparing a draft EIS, the agency solicited comments from the public."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Texas and Fasken",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1300",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-98dc84420df0-0004-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 47,
        "start": 47
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "Texas and Fasken claim they are entitled to proceed under the Hobbs Act itself."
    }
  ],
